@startuml complete-order-lifecycle
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EEF3FF
  BorderColor #370E4D
  ArrowColor #370E4D
}
title Enunas — Complete Order Lifecycle (State Machine)

state PENDING : Customer placed order\nPayment link generated\nStock NOT decremented\n\nTrigger: POST /orders

state PAID : Payment confirmed by Mollie webhook\nStock decremented (atomic SQL)\nLedger entries created (PENDING_RELEASE)\n7-day payout hold starts\n\nTrigger: POST /webhooks/mollie

state SHIPPED : Brand confirmed shipment\nCarrier + tracking number stored\nShippedAt timestamp set\n\nTrigger: PATCH /brand/orders/{id}/shipment

state DELIVERED : Order delivered to customer\nReturn window opens (14 days default)\n\nTrigger: Admin force-sets OR auto-confirmation

state SHIPPING_PROBLEM : Brand reported a logistics issue\nProblem description stored\n\nTrigger: POST /brand/orders/{id}/shipping-problem

state AWAITING_ADMIN : Shipping problem escalated\nAdmin review required\n\nTrigger: Admin state transition

state MANUAL_REVIEW : Admin is actively investigating\n\nTrigger: Admin escalation

state RETURN_REQUESTED : Customer submitted return request\nReturnOrder created (PENDING)\nReturnItems linked\n\nTrigger: POST /orders/{id}/return\n(order must be DELIVERED)

state RETURN_APPROVED : Admin approved return\nReturn label placeholder set\nApprovedAt timestamp recorded\n\nTrigger: POST /admin/orders/{id}/return/approve

state RETURN_RECEIVED : Goods received back at warehouse\nStock RESTORED for returned items (atomic)\nReceivedAt timestamp recorded\n\nTrigger: POST /admin/orders/{id}/return/receive

state REFUNDED : Mollie refund issued\nLedger REFUND_REVERSAL entry created\nBrandEconomics deducted\nPayment.status = REFUNDED\n\nTrigger: POST /admin/orders/{id}/return/refund

state CANCELLED : Order cancelled\nStock restored if was PAID\nCancellation reason + admin email stored\n\nTrigger: POST /admin/orders/{id}/cancel\nOR payment expiry (OrderExpiryService)

[*] --> PENDING : Customer: POST /orders\n→ OrderService.createOrder()

PENDING --> PAID : Mollie webhook fires\n→ confirmPaymentByWebhook()\n→ Stock decremented

PENDING --> CANCELLED : (a) Admin: POST /admin/orders/{id}/cancel\n[PENDING orders only]\n→ Sends cancellation email\n\n(b) OrderExpiryService\n[payment link expired]

PAID --> SHIPPED : Brand: PATCH /brand/orders/{id}/shipment\n{ carrier, trackingNumber }\n→ Order.shippedAt = now()\n→ Email sent to customer

PAID --> SHIPPING_PROBLEM : Brand: POST /brand/orders/{id}/shipping-problem\n{ problemDescription }\n→ problemReportedAt = now()\n→ problemReportedBy = brand

PAID --> CANCELLED : Admin force-cancels post-payment\n→ Stock RESTORED\n→ Manual Mollie refund required

SHIPPED --> DELIVERED : Admin: PATCH /admin/orders/{id}/status\nOR automatic confirmation

SHIPPED --> SHIPPING_PROBLEM : Brand reports problem after shipment

SHIPPING_PROBLEM --> AWAITING_ADMIN : Admin review triggered

AWAITING_ADMIN --> MANUAL_REVIEW : Admin escalates investigation

MANUAL_REVIEW --> REFUNDED : Admin resolves with refund\n→ Calls Mollie refund API

DELIVERED --> RETURN_REQUESTED : Customer: POST /orders/{id}/return\n{ reason, description }\n→ ReturnOrder.status = PENDING\n→ Order.status = RETURN_REQUESTED

RETURN_REQUESTED --> RETURN_APPROVED : Admin: POST /admin/orders/{id}/return/approve\n→ ReturnOrder.status = APPROVED\n→ ReturnOrder.approvedAt = now()\n→ Return label placeholder set

RETURN_APPROVED --> RETURN_RECEIVED : Admin: POST /admin/orders/{id}/return/receive\n→ ReturnOrder.status = RECEIVED\n→ ReturnOrder.receivedAt = now()\n→ Stock RESTORED for all ReturnItems

RETURN_RECEIVED --> REFUNDED : Admin: POST /admin/orders/{id}/return/refund\n{ refundAmount }\n→ Mollie refund API called\n→ LedgerEntry (REFUND_REVERSAL) inserted\n→ BrandEconomics deducted

REFUNDED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of PAID
  KEY MILESTONE:
  ─────────────────────────────
  stockQuantity decremented
  LedgerEntry.status = PENDING_RELEASE
  payoutEligibleAt = now + 7 days
  BrandEconomics.pendingBalance += brandPayout
  BrandEconomics.lifetimeRevenue += totalAmount
end note

note right of REFUNDED
  KEY ACTIONS:
  ─────────────────────────────
  Mollie: POST /v2/payments/tr_xxx/refunds
  LedgerEntry: REFUND_REVERSAL (status=REVERSED)
  reversalOfEntryId → links to ORDER_PAYMENT
  BrandEconomics: deducted (pendingBalance first,
    then payoutBalance, remainder → outstandingDebt)
  Payment.status = REFUNDED
end note

note right of RETURN_RECEIVED
  STOCK RESTORE:
  ─────────────────────────────
  UPDATE product_variants
  SET stock_quantity = stock_quantity + qty
  WHERE id = ? [atomic SQL]
end note

note right of CANCELLED
  STOCK NOTE:
  ─────────────────────────────
  PENDING → CANCELLED: no stock was held, no restore needed
  PAID → CANCELLED: stock was decremented, must be restored
  Admin cancellation of PAID order requires
    manual Mollie refund (no auto-refund on cancel)
end note

@enduml
